    "causal_summary": "product-owner is the single public skill identity for the Product Owner system. It routes a request to one of four packets through mode-registry.json and hub-router.json: sk-product-owner writes Barter tasks, bugs, Stories, Epics and docs, sk-create-figjam draws FigJam diagrams, from user flows to sequence, state, ER and gantt charts, and the vendored mcp-click-up and mcp-figma packets carry the ClickUp and Figma Desktop transports. The advisor sees one hub, and packetKind separates the workflow packets from the Figma transport.",
